"P1890035556" "So the Skulls were trying to poison those people by forcing them to overdose on Superadine? It just doesn't make sense. There's no connection at all between the Skulls and Peterson Waste Management. {HeroName}, I really think the Skulls are small time players with big time backing. I'd bet my life they're doing the bidding of somebody else!"
