"P2933951001" "The Skulls have started extorting money from the business owners in Kings Row. If the victims don't pay up, the Skulls trash their businesses. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Someone's got to get to Kings Row and show the Skulls they can't pick on Paragon City's businessmen.</A> I think you're just the one to do it."
// AcceptString :
"P987722904" "Go to Kings Row and show the Skulls they can't pick on Paragon City's businessmen"
// SendOffString :
"P2600966086" "You can find a lot of Skulls in the Gish or near the Royal Refinery."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2589624839" "Combat Skulls in Kings Row"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1638917000" "Those business owners can't stand up to the Skulls, {HeroName}. You're going to have to do it for them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2424198160" "You have discouraged the Skulls from extorting money from business owners in Kings Row."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3933007140" "Kings Row owes you one, {HeroName}. I'm glad we can keep the wheels of commerce turning over there."
